                <mxCell id="sys" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:15px&quot;&gt;Bet Ticker / History Enricher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[Software System — Apache Flink 1.18 + Pulsar Connector]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pipeline streaming de 4 capas:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ingestion → Bet Status Manager → Bet Enricher → Sink&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Construye EnrichedBet (snapshots completos) a partir de eventos&lt;br&gt;de placement y settlement, publica al topic &lt;i&gt;enriched-bets&lt;/i&gt;." style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#9BC2E6;strokeColor=#1F4E79;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeWidth=4;" parent="1" vertex="1">
