                <mxCell id="c3-bs" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Broadcast State GLOBAL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[MapState&amp;lt;String, List&amp;lt;*Version&amp;gt;&amp;gt;]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sport / Tournament / MarketDef /&lt;br&gt;Fixture / Market / Competitor&lt;br&gt;(+ Operator/Brand/Offering opc.)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Cada List ordenada por validFromMs.&lt;br&gt;Lookup vía VersionLookup.floor(list, ts)&lt;br&gt;(búsqueda binaria, ≈ TreeMap.floorEntry).&lt;br&gt;NO se usa TreeMap: Flink no lo serializa nativamente." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#BF8F00;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
